'''Headband''' (はちまき, ''Hachimaki'', '''Headband''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Power UP (Sm): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 20%.

